WEBVTT

00:00:29.742 --> 00:00:34.705
to boldly go where no one has gone before.

00:00:34.705 --> 00:00:36.190
Well —

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:41.654
(Applause) —

00:00:42.906 --> 00:00:47.561
I am the grandson of immigrants from Japan

00:00:47.561 --> 00:00:49.692
who went to America,

00:00:49.692 --> 00:00:53.177
boldly going to a strange new world,

00:00:53.177 --> 00:00:56.013
seeking new opportunities.

00:00:56.013 --> 00:00:59.499
My mother was born in Sacramento, California.

00:00:59.499 --> 00:01:01.940
My father was a San Franciscan.